# BUHASA SPORTS

This repository contains a static website for BUHASA SPORTS featuring kart racewears and boxing equipment.

## Pages included
- index.html
- karting.html
- boxing-equipment.html
- manufacturing.html
- contact.html
- kart-racing-suits.html
- kart-racing-gloves.html
- boxing-gloves.html
- boxing-headgear.html
- boxing-bags.html

## Notes
- Uses the uploaded `logo.png` on the site header.
- Includes basic SEO metadata and sitemap files.
- Product category pages use remote product imagery for presentation.
